  warning is the evidence rather than atlas's prediction. Second, the code-location IMAGE
  digest will differ from 7deb4a2's without the tree having changed: the check is hashing
  the trees inside both images, not comparing image digests, confirmed twice (imac on
  cfd2ca7/7deb4a2, and this repo on bfda7b6 from the other direction).

